{"command": "cd /tmp
# Check what sections 14 and 16 are
readelf -S libmonosgen-2.0.so.dbg 2>/dev/null | grep -E '^\s+\[(14|16)\]'

# Also check nearby FUNC symbols around 0x2f4b20 
readelf -sW libmonosgen-2.0.so.dbg 2>/dev/null | awk '
  $4 == "FUNC" {
    start = strtonum("0x"$2)
    size = $3 + 0
    if (start > 0x2e0000 && start < 0x300000) printf "  0x%x size=%d %s\n", start, size, $8
  }' | sort | head -30", "description": "Check sections and nearby functions"}
